olor: oklch(0.9 0 0);\" data-kid=\"8\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      \n      <div style=\"position: absolute; inset-x: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 10; padding: 12px 13px;\" data-kid=\"9\">\n        <h3 style=\"\n          margin: 0;\n          font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; color: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.72);\n          line-height: 1.35; overflow: hidden;\n          display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 1; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n          letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n        \" data-kid=\"10\">Quel iPhone acheter en 2024 ? - Léo Duff</h3>\n        <p style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 10.5px; color: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.3);\" data-kid=\"11\">2 days ago</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div style=\"\n      position: absolute; top: 42px; right: 8px; z-index: 50;\n      border-radius: 8px; width: 152px;\n      background: oklch(0.20 0 0);\n      border: 1px solid oklch(0.26 0 0);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px oklch(0 0 0 / 0.7);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    \" data-kid=\"12\">\n      <div style=\"padding: 3px;\" data-kid=\"13\">\n        <button style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 9px; border-radius: 5px; border: none; background: oklch(0.26 0 0); cursor: pointer; text-align: left;\" data-kid=\"14\">\n          <i class=\"ti ti-external-link\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: oklch(0.5 0 0); flex-shrink: 0;\" data-kid=\"15\"></i>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: oklch(0.88 0 0); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\" data-kid=\"16\">View Details</span>\n        </button>\n        <button style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 9px; border-radius: 5px; border: none; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; margin-top: 1px;\" data-kid=\"17\">\n          <i class=\"ti ti-trash\" style=\"font-size: 12px; color: oklch(0.628 0.258 29.23); flex-shrink: 0;\" data-kid=\"18\"></i>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: oklc